104
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:43,000
Well, we shouldn't assume things. Some people change.

105
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:47,000
Old rules. We'll eat together. Like always.

106
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:51,000
Can you believe the stuff we used to cook in school when we were broke?

107
